# Events (P11, premium — Cairo bought it) — demo requests (VS / Rider / VS Code REST Client).
#
# One-time local setup (Development) is the same as users.http. Student Affairs runs events; members (students and
# teaching staff) of the event's audience register themselves.

@host = http://localhost:5080
@adminToken = paste-the-admin-token-here
@studentToken = paste-a-students-token-here
@eventId = paste-the-id-from-the-create-here
@userId = paste-a-registered-members-id-here

### Student Affairs: draft an event (facultyId null = whole university; capacity null = unlimited)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/events
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Career fair",
  "description": "Meet 40 companies.",
  "facultyId": null,
  "venue": "Main hall",
  "startsAt": "2026-11-20T08:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-11-20T12:00:00Z",
  "capacity": 300,
  "registrationDeadline": "2026-11-19T20:00:00Z"
}

### Publish it (no notification — the event list is the channel)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/events/{{eventId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Members: upcoming events of their audience, with seats left and their own status
GET {{host}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Register (409 when full, closed or already registered) — and cancel until the start
POST {{host}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/registrations/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### My events
GET {{host}}/api/events/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Student Affairs: move it (a new time or venue notifies registrants)
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/events/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Career fair",
  "description": "Meet 40 companies.",
  "facultyId": null,
  "venue": "Hall 7",
  "startsAt": "2026-11-20T08:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-11-20T12:00:00Z",
  "capacity": 300,
  "registrationDeadline": "2026-11-19T20:00:00Z"
}

### Attendees, and check-in (from an hour before the start until the end)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/events/{{eventId}}/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/admin/events/{{eventId}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "{{userId}}" }

### Cancel the event (registrants are notified with the reason)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/events/{{eventId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Venue unavailable" }
